OL,5,G0900 Trucking Hell
OL,6,     FOn the M25 near Enfield two
OL,7,     Florries, two cars and a van have
OL,8,     Fpiled into each other, blocking
OL,9,     Fthree lanes. In a ten-mile
OL,10,     Ftailback the Lantern team must
OL,11,     Frecover the two artics.
OL,12,G0955 Police Interceptors
OL,13,     FThe interceptors smash down a door
OL,14,     Fto save a man's life, and a
OL,15,     Ffleeing Land Rover rams two cop
OL,16,     Fcars in a bid to get away.
OL,17,G1055 Police Interceptors
OL,18,     FThe team tackle some boozers in
OL,19,     FBarrow whose spirits are high and
OL,20,     Fthe cocky occupants of a Mondeo
OL,21,     Frefuse to face the bald facts
OL,22,     Fabout their tyres.
